## Review Notes

- **Provenance:** Adapted from Beautiful UI (https://www.beautifului.dev), © 2026 Shane Levine, MIT.
- **Why not reuse `TxStatusBadge`:** that component is a bordered pill locked to five tones with an icon; it accepts no arbitrary colour and does not suit dense table contexts.
- **Accessibility:** Upstream's dot is purely visual with no accessibility handling at all; this port adds the three-way identity resolution.
